   "en": "Wana ni Kakatta Cinderella"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "罠にかかったシンデレラ"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Twelve Nights Of Christmas"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "It is almost Christmas. Evie was evicted from her home and has no place to go. Her boss at the hotel where she worked gives her special permission to stay the night in the suite she had just cleaned. She wakes up at dawn to the feel of sweet lips on hers, and she finds an incredibly sexy man in front of her. Right then, the camera flashes and the paparazzi runs away with the picture of them together. What's going on? Still upset, she finally takes a closer look at the man and realizes that he is Rio, the owner of the hotel. Furious that he had been caught in a trap, he asks Evie a few questions. Satisfied with her answers, he declares, \"I'm going to announce that I'm engaged to you.\""
  },
